      "ings": [],
      "body": "Drain the bananas in the strainer over a bowl, 15 min, stirring once or twice without pressing. Expect ≈1 cup liquid."
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "ings": [],
      "body": "Boil the liquid in the small pot over medium-high until ≈⅓ cup of thin syrup is left, 6–8 min. Pour it back over the bananas and mash until mostly smooth."
